aces battle with dark elf poetry we  learned that the demon as the power to  allow asta to infiltrate the mind of  someone else read their memories and  communicate with them directly inside  their own mind during his fight with la  dros asta engages in an internal battle  with the demon inside his grimoire the  demon offers to defeat la rose for hasta  if only hasta would allow the demon to  take control of his body the demon says  that he has been waiting for a chance to  take possession of a physical body and  that he intends to take Asta's but asta  manages to stay in control and the demon  remains inside the grimoire hasta is  thus able to stay himself while still  using the demon's anti magic abilities  in fact as the most recent chapters of  the manga have shown and especially  after the six-month time skip through  immense training hasta is learning to  control the anti magic more and more  effectively and as a result he is  getting stronger and stronger during the  battle with the kotodama devil or demon  however you want to call him austin's  demon spoke to the other demon directly  the kotodama demon confirmed that Asta's  demon is from the same alternate  dimension as he is but the kotodama  demon also implied that Auster's demon  was a lower ranked demon than he is he  basically told us does demon to stay in  his place and to show respect to a high  ranked demon like him for his part  austin's demon did refer to the kotodama  demon as his senior or senpai but i'm  not sure if that was a serious statement  or if he was just mocking the kotodama  demon with that said from the  interaction between the two demons and  the kotodama demons implication that he  is a higher ranked demon and also from  the fact that in order to defeat the  kotodama demon astha needed the help of  lumière Licht and all the elves Yami you  know and so many others we can assume  that Auster's demon is not quite as  strong as the kotodama demon at least  not at this point in the story it is  quite possible that Auster's demon's  future potential is higher than the  kotodama demons or that Auster's demon  if he succeeded in actually possessing a  physical body himself instead of relying  on hasta would be significantly stronger  than he is now however based on the  limited information that we have at this  time I have to place the kotodama demon  above Asta's demon in terms of strength  so with that in mind next let's talk  about the kotodama demon and his unique  power as his name suggests this creature  uses kotodama magic which is a type of  magic that allows him to alter physical  reality with his words he can summon  everything from otherworldly monsters to  swords and all sorts of other magical  and non magical weapons by just  mentioning them verbally and he can also  manipulate a wide variety of objects and  even living beings at will as we have  seen throughout the story the kotodama  demon is a master manipulator so this  unique otherworldly power  suits him well one of the limitations of  kotodama magic is that the user can't  simply command another living being to  die but other than that this power is  pretty incredible and ridiculously  overpowered most magic from this world  has little to no effect on the kotodama  demon the only exceptions are Yami's  dark magic and of course aust as anti  magic but anti magic is also a type of  power that comes from a demon and  therefore from the alternate dimension  as mentioned earlier based on the  information we have so far in the story  I have to place the kotodama demon above  Asta's demon his strength the sheer  number of all pea warriors that were  required to come together to defeat the  kotodama demon and the demon's own feats  place him above us as demon for now but  Asta's demon certainly has the potential  to become stronger in the near future  and finally the strongest demon that we  are met so far is the newest arch  villain of the series the demon who  controls the entire Spade kingdom and  who goes by the name Meggie Kula now it  is true that as of right now we don't  have a lot of information about Meggie  Kula but I am ranking him as the  strongest demon that we have met thus  far for the following reasons  first of all from a narrative  perspective it would make sense that as  the story goes on and all the main  characters get stronger the villains  will also get stronger if Mikiko is  built up as this next major villain and  it turns out that Auster's demon can  just wreck him on his own the build up  will have been incredibly anticlimactic  second the ruler of the Hart kingdom  Laura Pacheco also known as beaver girl  stated outright in Chapter two to eight  that she believes that Meggie Kula is  stronger than the kotodama demon and  finally Meggie Kula seems to have the  special ability which allows him to  drain the mana of everyone in the spade  Kingdom and repurpose the power for his  own ends  moreover Meggie cool appears to be  allowing multiple people to use part of  his demon power at once without him  needing to actually directly possess  their bodies judging by the power of the  dark triad the current rulers of the  spade kingdom who seem to be getting  their strength directly from a key Kula  it is safe to assume that McGillis power  is unlike anything we've seen before  or xenon alone was able to defeat an  entire Diamond Kingdom army by himself  with incredible ease and he turned out  to be so strong that even Luck voltea  himself was scared of him  assuming that xenon is only using a  fraction of McGhee colas true powers  since other members of the Spade ruling  elite have also been using McGillis  power at the same time it isn't hard to  imagine that at full power mcgee kula  would be an absolute monster when it  comes to overall strength we can't  forget that mcgee cola is said to have  killed the insanely strong aussie a  silva with one of his curses and he was  also able to place a deadly curse on  beaver girl I still have a sneaking  suspicion that hacia Silva isn't really  dead but even so  McGee Cola is in my opinion the  strongest demon or devil that we have  met up to this point in the story but  let me know what you guys think do you  agree with my rankings and is there  anything I forgot about the demons that  you would have liked to see mentioned in  this video overall we still know very  little about the demons their origins  their true intentions and their rare and  otherworldly powers but that lingering  mystery is part of the fun and I can't  wait to learn more about McGee Kula in  particular if you enjoyed this video you  want to see more black clover content on  the channel please leave a like to let  me know it really does help and if you  happen to be new to anime uproar don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications a big shout out to colored  clovers a dedicated team of artists who  work hard every week to bring the black  horror manga to life by coloring all the  panels the black clover series is still  highly underrated so it's always great  to see such dedicated fans and talented  artists working hard I especially want  to single out Yuri and one hooks I  really love these guys I follow their  art every week they are amazing please  show them some love  I will link to their Twitter profiles  down in the description I want to give a  massive thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons who support the channel  and make what we do possible with all  the problems on YouTube lately patrons  support means more than ever so thank  you guys so much special thanks to all  of our pro hero tier patrons include  the one and only Gilgamesh nothing but a  fan Jason Wilson Kings Eldred fitty  dolla beat Anatole kazansky alpha do on  hell crews and team Sparky 65 and I  can't forget the ones who rise above all  other clans a huge thank you to all of  our the one tier patrons including in  grata alone Adam  Matty Mac makoto-kun 